  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE**__:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nWe check the options one by one.\n\n**Option (1)**: ÷ and -\n\nGiven equation is: 45 × 10 - 125 ÷ 25 + 5 = 30 \n\nAfter the sign interchange, the equation is: 45 × 10 ÷ 125 - 25 + 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ 45 × __**10 **____**÷ **____**125**__ - 25 + 5 = 30 \n\n​⇒ __**45 × 0.08**__ - 25 + 5 = 30\n\n​⇒ __**3.6**__ - 25 __**+ 5**__ = 30 ​\n\n​⇒ __**8.6 - 25**__ = 30 \n\n**-16.4 ≠ 30 **\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (2)**: × and -\n\nGiven equation is: 45 × 10 - 125 ÷ 25 + 5 = 30 \n\nAfter the sign interchange, the equation is: 45 - 10 × 125 ÷ 25 + 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ 45 - 10 × __**125 ÷ 25**__ + 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ 45 - __**10 × 5**__ + 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ __**45**__ - 50 __**+ **____**5**__ = 30 \n\n⇒ 50 - 50 = 30\n\n0 ≠ 30 \n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option (3)**:** ** - and + \n\nGiven equation is: 45 × 10 - 125 ÷ 25 + 5 = 30 \n\nAfter the sign interchange, the equation is: 45 × 10 + 125 ÷ 25 - 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ 45 × 10 +** **__**125 ÷ 25**__ - 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ __**45 × 10**__** **+ 5 - 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ __**450 + 5**__ - 5 = 30\n\n⇒ __**455 - 5**__ = 30 \n\n**450 ≠ 30 **\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option (4)**: × and +\n\nGiven equation is: 45 × 10 - 125 ÷ 25 + 5 = 30 \n\nAfter the sign interchange, the equation is: 45 + 10 - 125 ÷ 25 × 5 = 30 \n\n⇒ 45 + 10 - __**125 ÷ 25**__ × 5 = 30\n\n⇒ 45 + 10 -** **__**5 × 5**__ = 30\n\n⇒ __**45 + 10**__ - 25 = 30\n\n⇒ __**55 - 25**__ = 30\n\n**30 = 30 **\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× and +\"**.\n\n83:T21",
